msgid "- Check share permissions (read/write)\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Verificar las permissions de partatge (legir/escriure)\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Ensure NAS is powered on and accessible\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Asseguratz-vos que lo NAS es alimentat e accessible"

msgid "- Enter server IP, share name, username and password\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Picatz l'IP del servidor, lo nom de partatge, lo nom d'utilizaire e lo senhal\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Go to Main Menu > Setup > System > Storage Manager\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Anar al Menú principal > Configuracion > Sistèma > Gestionari d'emmagazinatge\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- HDD backups: Stored in /media/hdd/backup\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sauvagardas HDD : Enregistradas dins /media/hdd/sauvagarda\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Keep regular backups of your system\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Gardar de còpias de seguretat regularas de vòstre sistèma\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- NET backups: Require mounted CIFS/NFS share with write permissions\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sauvagardas NET : Requerisson lo partatge CIFS/NFS montat amb d'autorizacions d'escritura\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Never interrupt backup/restore processes\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Interrompre pas jamai los processus de salvament/restauracion\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Restore: Works from HDD, USB, NET or MMC storage\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Restaurar: Fonciona a partir d'emmagazinatge HDD, USB, NET o MMC"

msgid "- Select 'Network Storage' and add your NAS/SMB share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Seleccionatz 'Emagazinatge en ret' e apondètz vòstre partatge NAS/SMB"

msgid "- Test connection with ping command\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Testar la connexion amb la comanda ping\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- USB backups: Require FAT32-formatted drive with 'backupstick' file\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sauvagardas USB : Necessitan un disc formatat FAT32 amb un fichièr 'backupstick'\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Use quality USB drives for recovery sticks\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Utilizar de discs USB de qualitat pels bastonets de recuperacion\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify username/password are correct\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Verificar que lo nom d'utilizaire/senhal son corrèctes\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify you have enough free storage space\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Verificatz qu'avètz pro d'espaci d'emmagazinatge liure\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "1. Mount your network share first:\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "1. Montatz vòstre partatge de ret d'en primièr:\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "2. Select 'NET Backup' from the device list\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "2. Seleccionatz 'NET Backup' dins la lista dels periferics\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "3. Choose your mounted network share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "3. Causissètz vòstre partatge de ret montat"

msgid "A recording is currently running. Please stop the recording before trying to start a flashing."
msgstr "Un enregistrament es actualament en cors. Mercés d'arrestar l'enregistrament abans d'ensajar de començar un relambi."

